+def Dirent.reclen (e : Dirent) : Nat := (19 + e.name.length + 1 + 7) / 8 * 8
+
+/-- FV_7zip G1: what a directory gives `getdents64(2)` with room for `count` bytes (`fs/readdir.c` `iterate_dir`):
