+All of exception type 4 or 6 (SDM Vol. 2, 2.5.1): a memory operand at any alignment. A 256-bit form works on each
+128-bit lane as the 128-bit form does, except `VPERM2I128` and `VBROADCASTI128`, which move whole lanes. -/
+
+/-- The 128-bit lanes of `a` (and `b`) each mapped by `f`. -/
+def perLane {w : Nat} (f : BitVec 128 → BitVec 128 → BitVec 128) (a b : BitVec w) : BitVec w :=
+  ofElems w 128 fun l => f (elem 128 a l) (elem 128 b l)
