+/-- VEX `VPSRLDQ` (`left = false`) and `VPSLLDQ`: each lane shifted by `imm8` bytes, 0 from 16 on (SDM Vol. 2B,
+"PSRLDQ", "PSLLDQ", VEX.256 Operation). -/
