+"XSAVEC", Operation; Vol. 1, 13.7, 13.10): `#UD` as `xEnabled`, `#GP(0)` unless the area is 64-byte aligned (not
+ordered with a fault of the access, `Op.checkAligned`); a requested-feature bitmap (`xRfbm`) with a component
+outside `xInsnHeld` is not modelled, nor `XSAVEC` with an aligned component (`Profile.xCompAligned`). `XINUSE` is
+left open within the manuals' bounds (`xInuseOf`).
