+/-- The runs `xsaveRuns` gives (in the standard format) moved to the compacted format of components `fmt`: a run in
+the extended region lies within one component, which moves from `Profile.xOffset` to `Profile.xCompOffset`. -/
+def xCompact (prof : Profile) (fmt : BitVec 64) (runs : List (Nat × List Byte)) : List (Nat × List Byte) :=
+  runs.map fun (o, bs) =>
+    if o < 576 then (o, bs) else
+    match xExtComps.find? (fun i => prof.xOffset i ≤ o && o < prof.xOffset i + prof.xSize i) with
+    | some i => (o - prof.xOffset i + prof.xCompOffset fmt i, bs)
+    | none => (o, bs)
