+/-- Whether plan `p` reads byte `o` of the area besides the header: the x87 state of the legacy region (bytes
+0–23, but `MXCSR` and `MXCSR_MASK`, and 32–159) with x87's load, `MXCSR` (24–27) when it is loaded, `XMM0`–`XMM15`
